# Docs live in the workspace

Write design notes, decisions, and project documents under `docs/` in this repository. Update `docs/README.md` when a new doc is added.

The source of truth is those files. A chat canvas may illustrate them. It does not replace them.

Read `docs/design-laws.md` before changing the product. A feature that breaks a law there needs an explicit decision recorded in `docs/`.
